3. Data
   The drone imagery, derived plant records, statistics, figures and screenshots of the
   Pilot block and the sample survey (in particular public/data/, public/sample/,
   public/showcase/, docs/assets/ and processing_outputs/) are project data owned by their
   respective owners. They are included for demonstration only. No rights to them are
   granted.

   Exception: models/identification_reference.joblib is a classifier trained on features
   from Meta's DINOv3 model. To the extent it is a derivative work of the DINO Materials,
   it is made available under the DINOv3 License (licenses/DINOv3-LICENSE.md), including
   its use restrictions (trade controls; no military, warfare, nuclear or weapons uses),
